I have corrected various bugs in the program and added lujvo splitting and
rafsi statistics, which can be switched off if not required. At this stage
the lujvo splitter is a separate LPeg module replicating most of the
morphology LPeg. This somewhat increases the processing time but prevents
the morphology section from falling apart during testing. There are still
bugs.

An updated package is available at http://galactinus.net/vilva/lllp.tgz

